ate-300 rounded border border-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <i data-lucide=\"refresh-cw\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i> Rescan Autoruns\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"cyber-card overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                    <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs font-mono\">\n                        <thead class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-400\">\n                            <tr>\n                                <th class=\"p-3\">Entry Name</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-3\">Location Vector</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-3\">Target Command / Path</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-3\">Status</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-3 text-right\">Action</th>\n                            </tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody id=\"persistence-table-body\">\n                            <!-- Populated dynamically -->\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ========================================== -->\n        <!-- TAB 5: SIMULATION LAB -->\n        <!-- ========================================== -->\n        <section id=\"view-simulation\" class=\"tab-content hidden space-y-4\">\n            <div class=\"cyber-card p-6 border-purple-500/40\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n                    <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/30\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"flask-conical\" class=\"w-8 h-8\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold font-mono text-white\">Safe Threat Simulation Sandbox</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 max-w-2xl\">\n                            Verify AegisShield's detection and eradication engine safely! These scenarios spawn completely harmless background Python processes that exhibit real-world malware behavioral patterns (e.g., Temp drop zones, obfuscated LOLBins, remote desktop beacons).\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6\">\n                    <!-- Scenario 1 -->\n                    <div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-900/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"font-bold text-sm text-white font-mono\">Scenario 1: Temp Drop Trojan</div>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1\">Spawns a benign process running out of %TEMP% mimicking a dropped Trojan payload.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <button onclick=\"spawnTestSimulation('temp_trojan')\" class=\"mt-4 px-3 py-2 bg-purple-600/30 hover:bg-purple-600 text-purple-200 text-xs font-mono font-bold rounded border border-purple-500/50 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"play\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i> Launch Temp Trojan\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Scenario 2 -->\n                    <div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-900/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"font-bold text-sm text-white font-mono\">Scenario 2: Obfuscated LOLBin</div>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1\">Launches a hidden process with base64/encoded download cradle flags.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <button onclick=\"spawnTestSimulation('encoded_cmdline')\" class=\"mt-4 px-3 py-2 bg-purple-600/30 hover:bg-purple-600 text-purple-200 text-xs font-mono font-bold rounded border border-purple-500/50 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"play\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i> Launch Encoded Cradle\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Scenario 3 -->\n                    <div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-900/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"font-bold text-sm text-white font-mono\">Scenario 3: Remote Desktop Beacon</div>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1\">Simulates an unauthorized VNC / RMM remote control session beacon.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <button onclick=\"spawnTestSimulation('rmm_beacon')\" class=\"mt-4 px-3 py-2 bg-purple-600/30 hover:bg-purple-600 text-purple-200 text-xs font-mono font-bold rounded border border-purple-500/50 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"play\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i> Launch RMM Beacon\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 flex justify-end\">\n                    <button onclick=\"cleanupSimulations()\" class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"trash-2\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-red-400\"></i> Terminate All Active Simulations\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ========================================== -->\n        <!-- TAB 6: INCIDENT AUDIT LOG -->\n        <!-- ========================================== -->\n        <section id=\"view-audit\" class=\"tab-content hidden space-y-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <div>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-base font-bold font-mono text-white\">Incident & Eradication Audit Trail</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Chronological ledger of scans, terminations, quarantines, and security events.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n                    <button onclick=\"loadAuditLog()\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"refresh-cw\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i> Refresh\n                    </button>\n                    <button onclick=\"exportAuditLog()\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-cyan-600/20 hover:bg-cyan-600/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono rounded border border-cyan-500/40 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"download\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i> Export Report (JSON)\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"cyber-card p-4\">\n                <div id=\"audit-log-container\" class=\"space-y-2 max-h-[500px] overflow-y-auto\">\n                    <!-- Populated dynamically -->\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Deep Inspection Modal -->\n    <div id=\"inspect-modal\" class=\"fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden\">\n        <div class=\"cyber-card max-w-2xl w-full p-6 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto\" id=\"inspect-modal-content\">\n            <!-- Populated dynamically -->\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Toast Notification Container -->\n    <div id=\"toast-container\"></div>\n\n    <!-- App JavaScript -->\n    <script src=\"/static/js/app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"c:\\Users\\thann\\Downloads\\AntiGravity\\SpywareProc